Captain America: The Winter Soldier

Captain America: The Winter Soldier yaiku film superhero &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah"&gt;Amerika&lt;/a&gt; saka Marvel Comics terbitan Captain America, kang digawé dening &lt;a href="Marvel%20Studios"&gt;Marvel Studios&lt;/a&gt; lan ditayangke dening Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures. Punika minangka sekuel ing film 2011 Captain America: The First Avenger lan film kesembilan Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU). Iki disutradarani dening Anthony lan Joe Russo, ditulis dening Christopher Markus lan Stephen McFeely, dibintangi &lt;a href="Chris%20Evans%20%28aktor%29"&gt;Chris Evans&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Scarlett%20Johansson"&gt;Scarlett Johansson&lt;/a&gt;, Robert Redford lan Samuel L. Jackson. Ing Kapten Amerika: Prajurit Mangsa, Kapten Amerika lan Black Widow nyatu kanggo mungkasi mungsuh ing ndhelikake kemul ing &lt;a href="Washington%2C%20D.C."&gt;Washington DC&lt;/a&gt;. Captain America: The Winter Soldier bakal dirilis tanggal 2 April 2014 kanggo Indonesia lan 4 April 2014 kanggo Amerika Serikat.
