Pirates of the Caribbean: On Stranger Tides nggih punika sesirah &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kaping sekawan saking &lt;a href="Pirates%20of%20the%20Caribbean%20%28seri%20film%29"&gt;Pirates of the Caribbean&lt;/a&gt;. Wonten filem punika &lt;a href="Jack%20Sparrow"&gt;Kapten Jack Sparrow&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Johnny%20Depp"&gt;Johnny Depp&lt;/a&gt;) nyawiji kaliyan Angelica (&lt;a href="Pen%C3%A9lope%20Cruz"&gt;Penélope Cruz&lt;/a&gt;) saperlu madosi &lt;a href="Air%20Mancur%20Awet%20Muda"&gt;Toya Mancur Awet Enom&lt;/a&gt;, ngadhepi bajak laut Blackbeard misuwur (&lt;a href="Ian%20McShane"&gt;Ian McShane&lt;/a&gt;). Filem punika kaangkat saking &lt;a href="novel"&gt;novel&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="On%20Stranger%20Tides"&gt;On Stranger Tides&lt;/a&gt; anggitanipun &lt;a href="Tim%20Powers"&gt;Tim Powers&lt;/a&gt;, ugi kapundhut saking &lt;a href="Permainan%20video"&gt;video games&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="LucasArts"&gt;LucasArts&lt;/a&gt; kanthi sesirah &lt;a href="The%20Secret%20of%20Monkey%20Island"&gt;The Secret of Monkey Island&lt;/a&gt;. Filem kaarahaken déning &lt;a href="Rob%20Marshall"&gt;Rob Marshall&lt;/a&gt;, lan kaserat skénariyonipun déning &lt;a href="Ted%20Elliott"&gt;Ted Elliott&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Terry%20Rossio"&gt;Terry Rossio&lt;/a&gt;. Ingkang kajibah minangka juru damel film nggih punika &lt;a href="Jerry%20Bruckheimer"&gt;Jerry Bruckheimer&lt;/a&gt;.
