<doc id="161401" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=161401" title="Real Steel">
Real Steel

Real Steel nggih punika sesirah &lt;a href="Film"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="fiksi"&gt;fiksi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sains"&gt;sains&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; taun 2011. Filem punika kaarahaken déning Shawn Levi. Piyambakipun ugi ngrangkep minangka juru damel, sesarengan Susan Monford lan Don Murphy. Skénario kaanggit déning Dan Gilroy lan Jeremy Leven, adhedhasar saking In Part on the Short Story pakaryanipun Richard Matheson. Tanggel jawab musik kapasrahaken dhumateng Danny Elfman. Sinematografi dipuncakaken déning Mauro Fiore. Wondéné pambesutan filem kalampahaken déning Dean Zimmerman. Juru paraga ingkang kadhapuk maragani filem punika antawisipun &lt;a href="Hugh%20Jackman"&gt;Hugh Jackman&lt;/a&gt;, Dakota Goyo, Kevin Durand, Evangeline Lilly, lan Hope David. Real Steel kababar ing surya &lt;a href="7%20Oktober"&gt;7 Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt; wonten &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;. Lumantar filem punika Hugh Jackman nampi bebungah saking &lt;a href="People%27s%20Choice%20Awards"&gt;People's Choice Awards&lt;/a&gt; ing kategori Favorite Action Movie Star. Wondéné Dakota Goyo pikantuk bebungah saking &lt;a href="Young%20Artist%20Award"&gt;Young Artist Award&lt;/a&gt; ing kategori &lt;a href="Young%20Artist%20Award%20for%20Best%20Leading%20Young%20Actor%20in%20a%20Feature%20Film"&gt;Best Performance in a Feature Film - Leading Young Actor&lt;/a&gt;.
