Soul Surfer (filem)

Soul Surfer nggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sandiwara"&gt;sandhiwara&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; taun 2011. Filem punika kaarahaken déning &lt;a href="Sean%20McNamara"&gt;Sean McNamara&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun ughi ngrangkep minangka panganggit skénario, adhedhasar saking Soul Surfer pakaryanipun Bethany Amilton, Sheryl Berk, Lan Rick Bundschuh. Ingkang ngayahi jejibahan minangka juru damel, kajawi Sean, ugi wonten David Brookwell, Douglas Schwartz, lan Dutch Hofstetter. Tanggel jawab babagan musik kapasrahaken dhumateng Marco Beltrami. Sinematografi dipuncakaken déning John R. Leonetti. Wondéné pambesutan filem kalampahaken déning Jeff Canavan. Para juru paraga ingkang kadhapuk maragani antawisipun &lt;a href="AnnaSophia%20Robb"&gt;AnnaSophia Robb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Helen%20Hunt"&gt;Helen Hunt&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dennis%20Quaid"&gt;Dennis Quaid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Carrie%20Underwood"&gt;Carrie Underwood&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kevin%20Sorbo"&gt;Kevin Sorbo&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Ross%20Thomas"&gt;Ross Thomas&lt;/a&gt;.
FilmDistrict, ingkang ngadek ing wulan September 2010, nyawiji kaliyan dengan &lt;a href="TriStar%20Pictures"&gt;TriStar Pictures&lt;/a&gt; saperlu ngedum filem Soul Surfer wonten gedhung-gedhung bioskop. Filem punika kababar wonten &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt; ing surya 8 April 2011. Dumugi pungkasanipun pangeduman, filem punika kasil ngempalaken arta dumugi $43,000,000.
