The Disaster Artist (filem)

The Disaster Artist yaiku filem biografi drama komedi Amerika Serikat taun 2017 sing diarahake dening &lt;a href="James%20Franco"&gt;James Franco&lt;/a&gt; lan digawé dening James Franco, Vince Jolivette, Seth Rogen, Evan Goldberg lan James Weaver. Manuskrip filem iki ditulis dening Scott Neustadter lan Michael H. Weber adhedhasar buku The Disaster Artist: My Life Inside the Room, Film Paling Apes Paling Bakal Made dening Greg Sestero lan Tom Bissell. Juru paraga filem iki James Franco, &lt;a href="Dave%20Franco"&gt;Dave Franco&lt;/a&gt;, Seth Rogen, Alison Brie, Ari Graynor, &lt;a href="Josh%20Hutcherson"&gt;Josh Hutcherson&lt;/a&gt; lan Jacki Weaver.
Filem The Disaster yaiku film kolaboratif kaping wolu James Franco lan Seth Rogen sasampunipun Knocked Up, Pineapple Express, The Green Hornet, Iki Pungkasan, Wawancara. Filem kasebut uga minangka film kolaboratif katelu James Franco lan Dave Franco sawise film Milk and The Broken Tower. Filem kasebut wiwit tayang ing South by Southwest (SXSW) tanggal 12 Maret 2017. lan tayang ing Amerika Serikat tanggal 1 Desember 2017 kanthi winates lan kasedhiya ing tanggal 8 Desember 2017. Filem iki ditampa kanthi ulasan apik saka juru kritik.
