Zookeeper (filem)

Zookeeper nggih punika sesirah &lt;a href="Film"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika kaarahaken déning &lt;a href="Frank%20Coraci"&gt;Frank Coraci&lt;/a&gt;. Skénario kagem filem punika kaanggit déning Nick Bakay sesarengan Rock Reuben, Kevin James, Jay Scherick, lan David ROnn. Ingkang ngayahi jejibahan minangka juru damel nggih punika Todd Garner, Kevin James, &lt;a href="Adam%20Sandler"&gt;Adam Sandler&lt;/a&gt;, Jack Giarraputo, lan Walt Becker. Tanggel jawab musik kapasrahaken dhumateng Rupert Gregson-Williams. Sinematografi dipuncakaken déning Michael Barrett. Wondènè pambesutan filem kalampahaken dèning Scott Hill. Juru paraga ingkang kadhapuk maragani antawisipun &lt;a href="Kevin%20James%20%28aktor%29"&gt;Kevin James&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rosario%20Dawson"&gt;Rosario Dawson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Leslie%20Bibb"&gt;Leslie Bibb&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Steffiana%20De%20La%20Cruz"&gt;Steffiana De La Cruz&lt;/a&gt;. Filem kababar ing surya &lt;a href="8%20Juli"&gt;8 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;. Kanthi rantaman $80 yuta, filem punika kasil ngempalaken arta dumugi $167,582,857.
