<doc id="161548" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=161548" title="Niki Lauda">
Niki Lauda

Andreas Nikolaus "Niki" Lauda (#ALIH) nggih punika pembalap &lt;a href="Formula%20Satu"&gt;Formula Setunggal&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt;, Piyambakipun naté &lt;a href="Daftar%20Juara%20Dunia%20Pembalap%20Formula%20Satu"&gt;Juwara Donya Pembalap F1&lt;/a&gt; ping tiga, menang ing taun &lt;a href="Formula%20Satu%20musim%201975"&gt;1975&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Formula%20Satu%20musim%201977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Formula%20Satu%20musim%201984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;. Andras namung setunggalipun pembalap wonten sajarah F1 ingkang kasil ngrengkuh juwara kagem &lt;a href="Scuderia%20Ferrari"&gt;Ferrari&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="McLaren"&gt;McLaren&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun dipunanggep minangka pembalap F1 paling ageng dumugi wekdal punika. Kajawi punika, piyambakipun ugi naté dados konsultan kagem &lt;a href="Scuderia%20Ferrari"&gt;Scuderia Ferrari&lt;/a&gt; lan manajer tim saking tim balap Formula Setunggal &lt;a href="Jaguar%20Racing"&gt;Jaguar&lt;/a&gt;, kalih taun. Piyambakipun ugi nyambut damel minangka juru komentar ing Grand Prix F1 wonten TV Jerman lan &lt;a href="Ketua"&gt;ketua non-eksekutif&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Mercedes-Benz%20di%20Formula%20Satu"&gt;Mercedes-AMG Petronas Motorsport&lt;/a&gt;. Lauda kagungan 10% saham tim.
Lauda naté ketaton awit saking dhawah nalika &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20F1%20Jerman%201976"&gt;Grand Prix Jerman 1976&lt;/a&gt; wonten &lt;a href="N%C3%BCrburgring"&gt;Nürburgring&lt;/a&gt;, ing mriku Ferrari kagunganipun kobong, lan mèh kémawon pejah.
Sasampunipun mlebet wonten tim &lt;a href="Brabham"&gt;Brabham&lt;/a&gt; lan kalih taun mboten mbalap, Lauda nyobi mbalap ing sekawan mangsa kagem &lt;a href="McLaren"&gt;McLaren&lt;/a&gt;, taun 1982 dumugi 1985, piyambakipun kasil menang ing mangsa 1984, kacèk 0,5 poin saking &lt;a href="Alain%20Prost"&gt;Alain Prost&lt;/a&gt;.
Lauda séda nalika saweg saré, ing surya 20 Mei 2019 wonten &lt;a href="Rumah%20Sakit%20Universitas%20Zurich"&gt;Rumah Sakit Universitas Zurich&lt;/a&gt;.
