2012 nggih punika sesirah &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; fiksi ilmiyah pagebluk ingkang kadamel taun 2009. Filem punika kaarahaken déning &lt;a href="Roland%20Emmerich"&gt;Roland Emmerich&lt;/a&gt;. Juru paraga ingkang kadhapuk sami maragani antawisipun &lt;a href="John%20Cusack"&gt;John Cusack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Amanda%20Peet"&gt;Amanda Peet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Danny%20Glover"&gt;Danny Glover&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Thandie%20Newton"&gt;Thandie Newton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Oliver%20Platt"&gt;Oliver Platt&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chiwetel%20Ejiofor"&gt;Chiwetel Ejiofor&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Woody%20Harrelson"&gt;Woody Harrelson&lt;/a&gt;. 2012 dipundamel déning &lt;a href="Centropolis%20Entertainment"&gt;Centropolis Entertainment&lt;/a&gt; kagunganipun Emmerich, lan dipundum déning &lt;a href="Columbia%20Pictures"&gt;Columbia Pictures&lt;/a&gt;. Pamundhutan gambar kawiwitan ing wulan Agustus 2008 wonten &lt;a href="Vancouver"&gt;Vancouver&lt;/a&gt;, sinaosa èstunipun sampun karancang wonten &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles"&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;.
