<h2>Musik</h2>
Musik.
Musik asli kagem filem punika pakaryanipun &lt;a href="Harald%20Kloser"&gt;Harald Kloser&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Thomas%20Wander"&gt;Thomas Wander&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Adam%20Lambert"&gt;Adam Lambert&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="American%20Idol"&gt;American Idol&lt;/a&gt; menyumbang lagu kagem filem punika lumantar lagu kanthi sesirah &lt;a href="Time%20for%20Miracles"&gt;Time for Miracles&lt;/a&gt;. Musik ing filem punika wonten 24 track, kalebet Fades Like a Photograph anggitanipun &lt;a href="Filter%20%28band%29"&gt;Filter&lt;/a&gt; lan It's Not The End of The World anggitanipun Kloser lan Wander.
<h2>Pambabaran</h2>
Pambabaran.
2012 èstunipun bahde dipunbabar 0 Juli 2009. Titi wanci punika dipunowahi dados 12 November 2009 (13 Nov di AS). Miturut studio, filem punika badhé pinungkasan kagem titi wanci pambabaran ing mangsa katigga, nanging wonten pangowahan nalika pandamelan. Filem punika kababar 11 November 2009. Kababar ugi 13 November 2009 wonten &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, lan 21 November 2009 ing &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;. Pambabaran ageng kalaksanan wonten &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; surya13 November 2009. Ing &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt;, sapérang gedhung teater, kadosta Vue Cinemas Islington, nggadhahi titi wanci pambabaran ing bedhug 8:2 dalu (20:12) jumbuh kalian sesirahing gilem.
