<doc id="161647" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=161647" title="Avatar (filem 2009)">
Avatar (filem 2009)

Avatar, ingkang misuwur kanthi sesirah James Cameron's Avatar, nggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; fiksi ilmiyah pangembaran saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; taun 2009. Filem punika kaarahaken déning &lt;a href="James%20Cameron"&gt;James Cameron&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun ugi ngayahi jejibahan minangka juru damel, sesarengan &lt;a href="Jon%20Landau%20%28produser%20film%29"&gt;Jon Landau&lt;/a&gt;. Skénario kagem filem punika dipunanggit déning James Cameron piyambak. Avarat dipunparagani antawisipun &lt;a href="Sam%20Worthington"&gt;Sam Worthington&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Zoe%20Saldana"&gt;Zoe Saldana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Stephen%20Lang"&gt;Stephen Lang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Michelle%20Rodriguez"&gt;Michelle Rodriguez&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sigourney%20Weaver"&gt;Sigourney Weaver&lt;/a&gt;.
Filem Avatar katepangan kaping pisanipun wonten Odeon Leicester Square surya 10 Desember 2009. Salajengipun kababr ing &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt; surya 17 Desember 2009, lan di Amérikah Sarékat surya 18 Desember 2009. Avarat nampi pangalembana saking para juru kritik.
