<doc id="161698" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=161698" title="Fantastic Mr. Fox (filem)">
Fantastic Mr. Fox (filem)

Fantastic Mr. Fox nggih punika sesirah &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Komedi"&gt;komedi animasi&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; taun 2009. Filem punika kaarahaken déning &lt;a href="Wes%20Anderson"&gt;Wes Anderson&lt;/a&gt;. Ingkang ngayahi jejibahan minangka juru damel nggih punika Wes Anderson, &lt;a href="Scott%20Rudin"&gt;Scott Rudin&lt;/a&gt;, Allison Abbate. lan &lt;a href="Jeremy%20Dawson%20%28produser%29"&gt;Jeremy Dawson&lt;/a&gt;. Skénario kagem filem punika dipunanggit déning Wes Anderson lan Noah Baumbach, adhedhasar saking &lt;a href="buku"&gt;buku&lt;/a&gt; Fantastic Mr Fox pakaryanipun &lt;a href="Roald%20Dahl"&gt;Roald Dahl&lt;/a&gt;. Tanggel jawab musik kapasrahaken déning Alexander Desplat. Sinematografi dipuncakaken kaliyan Tristan Oliver. Pambesutan filem kalampahaken Andrew Wisblum. Wondéné juru paraga ingkang kadhapuk maragani antawisipun &lt;a href="George%20Clooney"&gt;George Clooney&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Meryl%20Streep"&gt;Meryl Streep&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jason%20Schwartzman"&gt;Jason Schwartzman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bill%20Murray"&gt;Bill Murray&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Willem%20Dafoe"&gt;Willem Dafoe&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Owen%20Wilson"&gt;Owen Wilson&lt;/a&gt;.
Filem Fantastic Mr. Fox dipuntepangaken kaping pisan nalika adicara pasanggiri &lt;a href="Festival%20Film%20London%20BFI"&gt;Festival Film London&lt;/a&gt; ing surya14 Oktober 2009. Salajengipun kababar kagem para pamirsa Amérikah Sarékat surya 13 November 2009 kanthi winatesan, lan surya 25 November 2009 langkung wiyar. Filem pampi pangalembana saking para juru kritik.
