The Hangover nggih punika sesirah &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="komedi"&gt;komedi&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; taun 2009. Filem punika kaarahaken déning &lt;a href="Todd%20Phillips"&gt;Todd Phillips&lt;/a&gt;. Skénariokagem filem punika dipunanggit déning &lt;a href="Jon%20Lucas"&gt;Jon Lucas&lt;/a&gt;. Ingkang ngayahi jejibahan minangka juru damel filem nggih punika Todd Phillips lan &lt;a href="Daniel%20Goldberg"&gt;Daniel Goldberg&lt;/a&gt;. Tanggel jawab prakawis musik kapasrahaken dhumateng Christopher Beck. Sinematografi dipuncakaken déning Lawrence Sher. Pambesutan filem kalampahan Debora Neil-Fisher. Wondéné juru paraga ingkang kadhapuk maragani antawisipun &lt;a href="Bradley%20Cooper"&gt;Bradley Cooper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ed%20Helms"&gt;Ed Helms&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Zach%20Galifianakis"&gt;Zach Galifianakis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Justin%20Bartha"&gt;Justin Bartha&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Heather%20Graham"&gt;Heather Graham&lt;/a&gt;. Filem punika kababar wong Amérika Lor surya 5 Juni 2009 lan nampi pangalembana saking para juru kritik, sarta para pamirsa. Dumugi pungkasanipun pangeduman, filem punika kasil ngempalaken arta dumugi $459.422.869, nglangkungi ardhana ingkang sampun dipuncakaken kagem kabetahan pandamelan, nggih punika namung $35 yuta.
