<doc id="161800" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=161800" title="The Hurt Locker">
The Hurt Locker

The Hurt Locker nggih punika &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sandhiwara"&gt;sandhiwara&lt;/a&gt; prayudan thriller saking &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; taun 2009. Filem punika kaarahaken déning &lt;a href="Kathryn%20Bigelow"&gt;Kathryn Bigelow&lt;/a&gt;. Ingkang ngayahi jejibahan minangka juru damel nggih punika Kathryn Bigelow, &lt;a href="Mark%20Boal"&gt;Mark Boal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nicolas%20Chartier"&gt;Nicolas Chartier&lt;/a&gt;, lan Greg Shapiro. Skénario kagem punika kaanggit déning Mark Boal. Tanggel jawab babagan musik kapasrahaken dhumateng Marco Beltrami lan Buck Sanders. Sinematografi dipuncakaken déning Barry Ackroyd. Juru paraga ingkang kadhapuk sami maragani antawisipun &lt;a href="Jeremy%20Renner"&gt;Jeremy Renner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Anthony%20Mackie"&gt;Anthony Mackie&lt;/a&gt;, Brian Geraghty, &lt;a href="Guy%20Pearce"&gt;Guy Pearce&lt;/a&gt;, David Morse, &lt;a href="Ralph%20Fiennes"&gt;Ralph Fiennes&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Evangeline%20Lilly"&gt;Evangeline Lilly&lt;/a&gt;.
Filem The Hurt Locker katepangaken kaping pisan nalika adicara &lt;a href="Festival%20Film%20Venesia"&gt;Festival Film Venesia&lt;/a&gt;, surya 4 September 2008. Salajengipun kababar kagem pamirsa Amérikah Sarékat ing surya 26 Juni 2009. Filem punika nampi pangalembana saking para juru kritik.
Filem The Hurt Locker kasil ngempalaken arta dumugi $9.228.768 saking pamirsa Amérika Lor, lan $22.201.566 saking negari sanèsipun, kanthi gunggung $49.230.772, nglangkungi rantaman ingkang namung $15 yuta.
